%F A126368 G.f.: (1+6*x-51*x^2+75*x^3+25*x^4-72*x^5+x^6+8*x^7) / ((1-2*x)*(1-3*x+x^2)*(1-3*x-x^2+3*x^3+x^4)). - _Colin Barker_, Jul 18 2017
